.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH songrec-gui 1  "gui " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
songrec\-gui \- The default action. Display a GUI.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsongrec gui\fR [\fB\-\-disable\-mpris\fR] [\fB\-\-disable\-pipewire\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIinput_file\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
The default action. Display a GUI.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\-mpris\fR
Disable MPRIS support
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\-pipewire\fR
Disable PipeWire native support
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIinput_file\fR]
An optional audio file to recognize on the launch of the application.
